# What: backport CVE-2026-85046 to V8 15.2.124.1 by rejecting mixed
# elements kinds when inlining Array.prototype.sort.
# Scope: Maglev/TurboFan implementation guards and the upstream regression test.
# Upstream M152 fix: https://github.com/v8/v8/commit/94c34b200ae9caf83d06c167a070746a1c7e825c
# CVE advisory: https://chromereleases.googleblog.com/2026/09/stable-channel-update-for-desktop_01882797386.html

